EZInvest, AI Agent for Investment Consulting Assistant
-Built a reinforcement learning-driven retrieval pipeline with Ray, optimizing tool selection for financial queries and reducing irrelevant data retrieval by 35% on benchmarks.
-Integrated FinBERT as a specialized module for financial text analysis, improving sentiment extraction accuracy in earnings calls by 15% over baseline LLMs.
-Fine-tuned gpt-oss:20B using QLoRA and 4-bit quantization on a single consumer GPU, cutting memory usage by 65% while preserving analysis quality.
-Implemented a hybrid FAISS (HNSW+IVF_PQ) and Redis Streams data pipeline for low-latency financial news ingestion.








